# A bodiless declaration with no later same-unit definition is an import,
# not a forward. Import resolution is not this ticket; it stays refused.
# S2, migrated by hand: a column-0 `return:` directly after this open header
# would be its return trailer, so the call is bound to a unit field first.
fn: imported (int: x) int
int: r imported(1)
return: r
